            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Gujarati for rubbish, then the Gujarati for a basket."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: પેટી",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "પેટી (peṭī) — \"a box\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "પેટી (peṭī) is a tadbhava. CDIAL lists it under peṭṭa, one of several forms beside Sanskrit piṭaka, \"basket, box\", which it calls non-Aryan (CDIAL 8164)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
