          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "મીણબત્તી (mīṇbattī) is \"wax-wick\": mīṇ, \"beeswax\", from the lexical Sanskrit madana, \"beeswax\" (CDIAL 9778), and battī, \"wick\", the Hindi form of Sanskrit varti, \"wick\" (CDIAL 11359)."
